MiniMax M2.5 is live now on OpenRouter!
@MiniMax_AI's update to their powerful agentic model M2.1 comes with improved reliability and performance on long running tasks. It's become a powerful general agent, capable of much more than writing code.
📷 https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HA-HsL8aIAAOk3C.jpg

@NousResearch + @OpenRouter + @MiniMax_AI 2.5 is a a lethal combo! Hermes took seconds to deploy and I added my OpenRouter API and started running commands.
Hermes just brings everything together and the M2.5 model is sharp as a tack for running tools.
(not paid promotion)

